# Cursor Rules for Direct Devise Project

## Environment Files Access
# Note: Cursor cannot directly access .env files for security reasons
# To help with debugging, you can:
# 1. Share specific env values when needed (without full keys)
# 2. Use the /api/test/config endpoint to verify configuration
# 3. Check server logs for environment variable issues

## Important Environment Variables
# VENT_AGENT_URL or NEXT_PUBLIC_VENT_AGENT_URL - URL of the ventilation agent server
# GEMINI_API_KEY or NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY - Gemini API key for LLM
# OCR_SPACE_KEY - OCR.space API key (optional)
# DATABASE_URL - PostgreSQL connection string

## Testing Configuration
# Visit http://localhost:3000/api/test/config to see if env vars are loaded
# Visit http://localhost:3000/api/test/extraction?companyId=XXX to test OCR extraction






